id: RS-SEC-014
title: Raw pointer dereference
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .rs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ target/ .git/
  content_contains: unsafe
patterns:
  - regex: \*\s*(mut|const)\s+\w|\bptr::(read|write|copy)
    message: Raw pointer operations — ensure memory safety invariants are upheld
fix: Use safe abstractions (slices, references) where possible, or document safety invariants with // SAFETY:
